## Entity Overview

| Entity | Relationship |
|---|---|
| `User` | Base account (email, password, role) |
| `Patient` | 1:1 with `User` |
| `Doctor` | 1:1 with `User`, N:1 with `Specialty` |
| `Specialty` | Referenced by `Doctor` |
| `Appointment` | N:1 with `Patient` and `Doctor` |
| `MedicalRecord` | 1:1 with `Appointment` |
| `Exam` | N:1 with `Appointment` |

## Running Locally

### With Docker (recommended)

```bash
git clone https://github.com/pergamota/Clinic-Hub.git
cd Clinic-Hub
docker compose up --build
```

- Application: `http://localhost:8080`
- Swagger UI: `http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html`

The `docker-compose.yml` spins up the application and a MySQL container
together, with a healthcheck ensuring the app only starts once the
database is ready to accept connections.

### Without Docker

Requires Java 21, Maven, and a running local MySQL instance.

```sql
CREATE DATABASE clinichub_db;
```

```bash
export DB_USERNAME=root
export DB_PASSWORD=your_password
export JWT_SECRET=a_secret_key_of_at_least_32_characters
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```

## API Documentation

Full interactive documentation is available via Swagger UI at
`/swagger-ui.html` once the application is running — every endpoint can be
tested directly from the browser, including JWT authorization via the
"Authorize" button.

Example endpoints:

```
POST   /api/auth/login
GET    /api/appointments
POST   /api/appointments
PUT    /api/appointments/{id}
GET    /api/doctors
POST   /api/doctors          (ADMIN only)
```

## Testing

```bash
./mvnw test
```

Unit tests (JUnit 5 + Mockito) cover the service layer for `Specialty`,
`Doctor`, and `Appointment` — including success paths, not-found scenarios,
and business rule violations (unique CRM, unique specialty name, no
past-dated appointments).

## Project Structure

```
src/main/java/com/clinichub/
├── config/          # Spring configuration (Security, OpenAPI)
├── controller/      # REST controllers
├── dto/             # Request/response DTOs
├── exception/       # Custom exceptions and global handler
├── mapper/          # Entity <-> DTO mapping
├── model/           # JPA entities
├── repository/      # Spring Data JPA repositories
├── security/        # JWT filter, token service, user details
└── service/         # Business logic

src/main/resources/static/    # Frontend (vanilla JS, role-based dashboards)
src/test/java/                # Unit tests
docs/                         # Requirements, models, roadmap
```

